  "label": "Anti-Black Stereotype: Questioning Parental Roles",
  "description": "The meme implicitly relies on the stereotype that Black families are less stable or that Black children are less capable of understanding traditional familial roles, by framing the question as a potential harm. This stereotype is part of a broader pattern of racialized assumptions about parenting and family structure in Black communities.",
